dhcp: Annotate the DHCP driver's return types

mypy only checks return statements in functions that declare a return
type. Annotating the DhcpBase and DhcpLocalProcess entry points makes
it check their bodies against the declared types.

Without the two preceding fixes in this series, this change makes mypy
report both missing returns.

